{
  "name": "lunheng-commands",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "论衡（lunheng-article-pipeline）的斜杠命令薄壳 wrapper。提供 11 个 /lunheng 命令：-draft/-resume/-cite/-audit/-journal/-ppt/-history/-rollback/-status/-help。借鉴 Ai4Scholar v2.9.5「斜杠命令 UX」设计；所有重活仍走论衡 9 角色流水线。",
